WEBVTT

01:38.560 --> 01:41.760
BASED ON THE NOVEL
"THE PRISONER OF BEAUTY" BY PENGLAI KE

01:48.360 --> 01:49.840
You think I'm gullible, don't you?

02:02.240 --> 02:04.040
Your clan is far too naïve.

02:06.760 --> 02:08.440
Do you think a betrothal

02:09.039 --> 02:11.000
can wipe out 14 years of hatred?

02:17.960 --> 02:20.480
Did you truly believe your beauty alone

02:20.560 --> 02:22.040
could enchant me?

02:31.480 --> 02:35.200
That crafty rat Qiao Gui
played his cards well,

02:35.280 --> 02:38.520
sending a granddaughter here
to act all gentle and sweet

02:38.600 --> 02:40.760
just to trick me
into allying with Yanzhou.

02:42.840 --> 02:44.880
Was this how he fooled my grandfather
back then?

02:48.960 --> 02:50.160
Let me tell you this.

02:55.080 --> 02:56.880
We won't fall for

02:58.240 --> 02:59.760
your clan's tricks twice.

03:08.120 --> 03:09.280
Lord Wei,

03:10.240 --> 03:12.000
are you breaking off the engagement?

03:12.080 --> 03:13.560
No.

03:15.560 --> 03:18.160
I'm just exposing your robbery-like deal.

03:40.880 --> 03:42.440
For the sake of this seal,

03:43.520 --> 03:44.520
I'll spare your life.

03:46.720 --> 03:47.640
However,

03:48.800 --> 03:51.840
pack your things immediately
and get out of Xindu.

03:53.440 --> 03:54.640
Oh, and by the way,

03:55.640 --> 03:57.880
tell your family to prepare themselves
and wait for me.

03:58.680 --> 04:00.320
I'm coming for them.

04:05.360 --> 04:06.720
- Guards.
- Here.

04:09.080 --> 04:10.160
Drag her out.

04:10.240 --> 04:11.160
Don't touch me!

04:12.520 --> 04:13.720
I misjudged you.

04:18.120 --> 04:19.600
Everyone, hurry up!

04:19.680 --> 04:21.600
General, what exactly is going on?

04:21.680 --> 04:23.880
Why are you taking my quilt?
Give it back.

04:24.200 --> 04:25.160
Give it back.

04:25.240 --> 04:27.320
Mother, why are they taking our things?

04:27.400 --> 04:28.880
- What's going on?
- What happened?

04:28.960 --> 04:29.800
- Hurry up!
- Stop!

04:29.880 --> 04:31.040
That's my chest.

04:31.120 --> 04:32.520
Wait.

04:32.600 --> 04:34.360
What are you doing?
We're moving things out.

04:34.440 --> 04:35.600
On whose orders?

04:35.680 --> 04:37.120
Mother, take this and that chest.

04:37.200 --> 04:38.000
Quickly!

04:38.080 --> 04:39.120
- Yes.
- Hold on.

04:39.760 --> 04:40.720
Wei…

04:40.800 --> 04:42.120
Don't move, don't move.

04:43.360 --> 04:44.320
Wei…

04:45.720 --> 04:46.920
Duang.

04:47.600 --> 04:49.480
Duang who? My name is Wei Liang.

04:49.560 --> 04:52.360
Whatever. Why are you taking our things?

04:52.440 --> 04:53.600
General Wei Liang,

04:53.680 --> 04:55.600
didn't we agree that
we would discuss marriage?

04:55.680 --> 04:57.320
Why are you expelling us from Xindu?

04:57.400 --> 04:58.840
So many questions!

04:58.920 --> 05:00.360
- Take these away.
- Hurry up!

05:00.440 --> 05:01.480
Come on.

05:01.560 --> 05:02.800
- Hurry.
- Get up.

05:03.480 --> 05:04.520
Take it away.

05:04.600 --> 05:05.840
What are you doing?

05:05.920 --> 05:07.000
Stop, Xiaotao.

05:07.080 --> 05:08.160
- Stop, Xiaotao.
- Stop.

05:08.240 --> 05:09.800
- Let go. Let go.
- Don't fight.

05:10.160 --> 05:11.840
- General Wei Duang…
- "Wei Duang"?

05:11.920 --> 05:13.440
It's Wei Liang. Wei Liang!

05:15.080 --> 05:17.360
There must be some misunderstanding.

05:17.440 --> 05:19.200
Miss Xiaoqiao has gone
to see His Lordship.

05:19.280 --> 05:21.920
Surely soon, the Lord of Wei
will order the marriage.

05:23.360 --> 05:25.720
Expelling you from Xindu was his order.

05:26.320 --> 05:28.000
This chubby girl is quite strong.

05:28.080 --> 05:29.000
What?

05:29.600 --> 05:30.920
Hurry and send them away.

05:31.000 --> 05:31.720
I…

05:31.800 --> 05:33.400
Why are they expelling us?

05:33.480 --> 05:34.800
No idea.

05:34.880 --> 05:36.600
Miss Xiaoqiao fell into their trap.

05:36.680 --> 05:39.800
How can I face His Lordship now?

05:39.880 --> 05:40.840
What should we do?

05:40.920 --> 05:42.240
What if Miss Xiaoqiao comes back?

05:42.320 --> 05:43.360
Quick, load the carts.

05:43.440 --> 05:44.320
Okay.

05:44.400 --> 05:45.440
This, this…

05:45.520 --> 05:46.640
Don't…

05:47.800 --> 05:49.600
PANYI ANNALS
HUMANITIES, SITUATION

05:49.680 --> 05:50.800
My lord.

05:50.880 --> 05:52.320
This isn't good, right?

05:52.680 --> 05:54.440
We've exchanged the Letter of Marriage.

05:54.520 --> 05:56.480
We should proceed with
the marriage as agreed.

05:57.280 --> 05:58.920
What's not good about it?

05:59.000 --> 06:00.920
The Qiao clan can break promises,

06:01.000 --> 06:02.520
but our retraction is not allowed?

06:02.600 --> 06:05.560
But they have already offered Panyi.

06:09.600 --> 06:11.600
Even if they hadn't offered it,

06:11.680 --> 06:12.880
I'd have taken it myself.

06:14.680 --> 06:15.960
That's true.

06:17.760 --> 06:19.080
Moreover,

06:20.120 --> 06:22.280
she wasn't sincere
in offering it to me anyway.

06:23.800 --> 06:25.560
She is just compromising

06:26.800 --> 06:28.040
to bind me in marriage to her.

06:29.160 --> 06:30.720
If I don't expel her,

06:31.480 --> 06:33.760
they'll only push us more.

06:36.440 --> 06:38.080
Do they really think

06:38.160 --> 06:39.920
this overwhelming hatred

06:40.000 --> 06:41.760
can be wiped away so easily?

06:44.120 --> 06:45.920
It makes sense.

06:48.840 --> 06:50.160
What do you think?

06:50.240 --> 06:52.240
- I don't see the problem.
- Makes sense.

06:52.320 --> 06:54.720
- It's reasonable.
- Indeed.

06:54.800 --> 06:56.760
But she is, after all, a woman.

07:05.160 --> 07:08.080
Get out of Xindu!

07:08.160 --> 07:09.600
Don't come back!

07:12.840 --> 07:15.600
"When a hen crows,
the family will perish!"

07:15.680 --> 07:16.720
That's nonsense!

07:16.800 --> 07:20.840
In family matters,
we must never let women decide.

07:20.920 --> 07:21.840
Xiaotao.

07:23.240 --> 07:25.320
The most important thing now
is planning our next step.

07:25.400 --> 07:28.640
We must find a way to get to Panyi
and oppose Wei Shao.

07:50.760 --> 07:51.760
Protect Miss Xiaoqiao!

07:54.840 --> 07:57.000
Charge!

07:58.280 --> 07:59.560
Kill them!

08:01.840 --> 08:02.640
It's Young Master Liu.

08:02.720 --> 08:04.000
He's come to save us.

08:04.080 --> 08:05.720
- Kill them.
- Kill the traitors!

08:10.280 --> 08:11.400
Young Master?

08:11.480 --> 08:13.160
Young Master,
the Wei rebels have been cleared.

08:13.240 --> 08:14.760
He's not a good person either.

08:14.840 --> 08:16.960
He might be here
to take advantage of the situation.

08:17.040 --> 08:20.560
Are we just going from the frying pan
into the fire?

08:21.160 --> 08:22.320
My lady,

08:22.400 --> 08:23.520
what should we do?

08:23.600 --> 08:24.560
Xiaoqiao!

08:24.640 --> 08:25.720
I came late.

08:25.800 --> 08:27.440
Were you frightened?

08:27.520 --> 08:28.480
Go check it out.

08:41.640 --> 08:42.480
Yan.

08:42.559 --> 08:43.440
Xiaoqiao.

08:43.520 --> 08:47.480
- I knew you would come to save me.
- Xiaoqiao.

08:54.800 --> 08:56.960
Xiaoqiao, don't be afraid.
Am I not here now?

09:00.560 --> 09:01.440
But…

09:02.040 --> 09:03.400
it's all my fault.

09:03.480 --> 09:07.920
I delayed the marriage between us
because of family matters.

09:08.000 --> 09:11.720
Now I've been driven out of Xindu
by Wei Shao.

09:12.320 --> 09:16.560
Fortunately, you didn't abandon me
and were willing to come save me.

09:17.000 --> 09:20.400
But I fear that if Wei Shao
learns of your actions,

09:20.480 --> 09:24.800
he might take it out on Liangya
and start a war.

09:24.880 --> 09:26.440
That's not what I want.

09:30.120 --> 09:30.840
Yan,

09:31.640 --> 09:36.320
why don't we take down Wei Shao
in one move

09:36.400 --> 09:37.880
to eliminate future troubles?

09:38.280 --> 09:39.120
Xiaoqiao,

09:39.960 --> 09:42.000
we are a fated couple,

09:42.080 --> 09:43.440
sharing glory and shame.

09:44.200 --> 09:45.120
For now,

09:45.200 --> 09:47.600
let's settle in Panyi first
and then plan carefully.

09:50.360 --> 09:52.600
But I lost Panyi's seal.

09:53.120 --> 09:55.400
Xiaoqiao, you are the seal.

09:55.840 --> 09:57.880
With you here, we can enter the city.

09:59.760 --> 10:00.800
You're right.

10:02.160 --> 10:03.400
You must be tired from travel.

10:03.480 --> 10:04.920
Rest in the carriage first.

10:05.000 --> 10:06.240
We'll depart immediately.

10:08.160 --> 10:09.440
Okay.

10:21.280 --> 10:23.800
She's just some dumped woman.

10:23.880 --> 10:26.640
Why are you so hung up on her?

10:30.480 --> 10:32.040
She's not some dumped woman.

10:32.840 --> 10:34.040
She's a treasure in this world.

10:36.640 --> 10:37.640
Rest assured, Uncle.

10:38.320 --> 10:39.720
I won't forget our priorities.

10:40.160 --> 10:41.400
Good that you know.

10:42.040 --> 10:43.040
Remember,

10:43.120 --> 10:45.880
none of the Qiao clan are good people.

10:45.960 --> 10:47.560
They judge people by their status.

10:47.640 --> 10:50.480
They wouldn't even offer a dowry
of 10,000 taels of gold when it was you,

10:50.880 --> 10:54.560
but when it was Wei Shao,
they gave away all of Panyi as a dowry.

10:59.480 --> 11:01.720
My lady, you're a fast learner.

11:01.800 --> 11:03.000
Quite impressive.

11:03.520 --> 11:06.480
Your hypocritical act was the same
as the Lord of Wei's.

11:07.120 --> 11:08.200
Xiaotao.

11:09.360 --> 11:10.840
Looked real, right?

11:10.920 --> 11:11.960
Let's go.

11:14.160 --> 11:16.560
QIAO MANSION, YANZHOU

11:16.640 --> 11:18.880
Say that again. Where's Xiaoqiao?

11:19.440 --> 11:21.960
She went back to Panyi
with Young Master Liu.

11:23.520 --> 11:25.400
She sent me back

11:25.480 --> 11:26.800
to report to her grandfather.

11:26.880 --> 11:27.800
What did she say?

11:28.320 --> 11:29.200
She said

11:29.280 --> 11:31.520
that Panyi is a gateway to Yanzhou.

11:31.600 --> 11:33.880
She won't hand it over willingly.

11:33.960 --> 11:37.600
Why bother? Why compete with Wei Shao?

11:37.680 --> 11:40.400
Even if Panyi is lost, I won't blame her.

11:40.480 --> 11:41.800
- Indeed.
- This…

11:42.280 --> 11:43.920
Why bother?

11:44.000 --> 11:45.000
Yue,

11:45.760 --> 11:47.840
we should send troops to Panyi

11:48.720 --> 11:49.840
and bring her back.

11:50.960 --> 11:52.080
This…

11:52.760 --> 11:54.320
That isn't necessary.

11:57.640 --> 12:01.880
Manman has a stubborn streak.

12:08.040 --> 12:10.000
She can't be stopped.

12:12.360 --> 12:13.320
But…

12:26.640 --> 12:27.640
Aunt,

12:29.360 --> 12:30.880
I won't fool around from now on.

12:32.280 --> 12:33.400
I'll study hard.

12:34.880 --> 12:36.120
I'm incompetent.

12:37.880 --> 12:39.680
I couldn't protect my own family.

12:45.280 --> 12:46.400
Ci,

12:48.880 --> 12:50.480
as long as you have ambition,

12:51.240 --> 12:54.360
unlike your weak-willed uncle,

12:55.600 --> 12:57.640
you can become one of Yanzhou's finest.

13:08.240 --> 13:11.840
OUTSKIRTS OF YANZHOU

13:23.400 --> 13:24.240
Sit.

13:37.960 --> 13:39.240
Have some water.

13:48.520 --> 13:50.600
I miss my mother somewhat.

13:51.600 --> 13:53.200
I don't know how she's doing now.

13:54.760 --> 13:56.680
I also miss Manman.

13:57.840 --> 14:00.840
These past few days,
I've thought many things through.

14:00.920 --> 14:04.600
She must've lied about
wanting to marry the Lord of Wei.

14:07.520 --> 14:09.600
I wonder how she's doing now.

14:10.360 --> 14:11.320
Fan,

14:13.280 --> 14:16.920
when passing by a nearby teahouse,
I heard that…

14:18.920 --> 14:21.240
she was expelled from Xindu
by the Lord of Wei.

14:25.840 --> 14:28.480
She went toward Panyi with Liu Yan.

14:35.000 --> 14:36.160
If you're worried,

14:36.240 --> 14:38.080
let's go to Panyi to find her.

14:40.720 --> 14:41.680
Or…

14:43.080 --> 14:45.720
if you want to reunite with your family,

14:45.800 --> 14:47.560
I can take you back to Kangjun.

14:48.760 --> 14:50.960
As much as I want to stay with you,

14:52.040 --> 14:54.320
I can't bear to see you
in tears every day.

14:56.040 --> 14:57.040
Fan.

15:02.480 --> 15:04.000
Rest assured,

15:04.080 --> 15:05.480
I'll always be there for you.

15:11.600 --> 15:12.440
Bi Zhi,

15:13.600 --> 15:15.120
let's go to Panyi.

15:15.200 --> 15:16.720
If you say Panyi,

15:16.800 --> 15:18.040
then Panyi it is.

15:19.960 --> 15:21.880
Things in Xindu are pretty much settled.

15:22.640 --> 15:23.720
Tell the soldiers

15:24.520 --> 15:25.800
we'll take Panyi tomorrow.

15:26.520 --> 15:27.480
- Yes.
- Yes.

15:29.240 --> 15:30.200
My lord.

15:31.760 --> 15:32.960
Why so flustered?

15:33.760 --> 15:34.680
A report from Panyi.

15:34.760 --> 15:36.440
Liangya's Young Master Liu Yan

15:36.520 --> 15:39.920
entered Panyi last night
and took over the city's defenses.

15:48.280 --> 15:49.880
What did he use to open the city gates?

15:52.000 --> 15:52.760
Lady Qiao.

15:53.640 --> 15:54.640
Which Lady Qiao?

15:55.520 --> 15:57.520
The one you drove out.

16:08.480 --> 16:10.160
I should have killed her long ago.

16:12.480 --> 16:13.760
Pass on my order.

16:14.880 --> 16:16.760
Lady Qiao has eloped with Liu Yan

16:17.600 --> 16:19.200
and is hiding in Panyi.

16:21.640 --> 16:22.840
Tell the soldiers

16:24.120 --> 16:25.640
to follow me in another battle.

16:25.720 --> 16:26.520
Yes.

16:26.600 --> 16:27.600
My lord, wait.

16:28.160 --> 16:31.160
In my view, this matter is suspicious.
Maybe there's a misunderstanding.

16:31.240 --> 16:33.920
We should find Lady Qiao
and ask her first.

16:34.000 --> 16:35.240
You're right.

16:37.000 --> 16:38.240
Find Lady Qiao

16:40.520 --> 16:42.080
and kill her to boost morale.

16:55.840 --> 16:56.560
Wake up.

16:58.920 --> 17:00.360
Having nightmares?

17:04.920 --> 17:06.920
I won't let this nightmare come true.

17:07.839 --> 17:09.200
Have some water.

17:21.720 --> 17:23.560
My lady, the Young Master
requests a meeting.

17:38.640 --> 17:39.680
Young Master.

17:41.720 --> 17:42.600
Xiaoqiao.

17:53.480 --> 17:54.360
Xiaoqiao.

17:56.520 --> 17:57.640
It was late yesterday,

17:57.720 --> 18:00.480
and we only met briefly
before we hurried on.

18:00.560 --> 18:02.280
Now that we've settled in Panyi,

18:02.360 --> 18:04.760
I've come to speak with you
about our marriage.

18:08.160 --> 18:10.000
I understand your intentions.

18:10.640 --> 18:13.040
But such important matters
should not be rushed.

18:13.520 --> 18:16.200
I need to consult my uncle and my father
and get their opinions.

18:16.760 --> 18:19.520
Can we discuss it
when we're back in Kangjun?

18:21.240 --> 18:22.560
Miss Xiaoqiao,

18:22.640 --> 18:27.840
let's not bother
with all these rules at this point.

18:28.600 --> 18:32.400
If we keep dragging on,
everyone will be exhausted.

18:32.480 --> 18:33.920
In my opinion,

18:34.000 --> 18:36.800
we'd better keep it simple.

18:36.880 --> 18:39.760
We've already asked
the Mayor of Panyi, Yang Feng,

18:40.280 --> 18:44.160
to receive the rites on behalf of
the governor and the prefect.

18:44.240 --> 18:45.240
Simple, isn't it?

18:46.000 --> 18:47.200
Isn't it perfect?

18:48.880 --> 18:49.680
Now!

18:49.760 --> 18:53.160
Here are the betrothal gifts
from Liangya's royal family.

18:53.560 --> 18:55.440
A pair of wild geese,

18:55.520 --> 18:56.600
a pair of mandarin ducks,

18:56.680 --> 18:58.640
one million coppers,

18:58.720 --> 19:00.080
ten duan of silk,

19:00.160 --> 19:01.600
ten duan of multicolored silk,

19:01.680 --> 19:03.560
twelve hu of sake,

19:03.640 --> 19:05.320
twelve hu of baijiu,

19:05.400 --> 19:07.000
twelve hu of rice,

19:07.080 --> 19:08.400
twelve hu of proso millet,

19:09.040 --> 19:10.320
and one lynx.

19:17.800 --> 19:20.640
My uncle is a bit impatient.

19:20.720 --> 19:22.600
But if I'm to take control of Panyi,

19:22.680 --> 19:25.560
I must marry you to legitimate my claim.

19:25.640 --> 19:27.440
You're right.

19:27.520 --> 19:29.160
I'll follow all your arrangements.

19:30.000 --> 19:32.520
But I fear Wei Shao may come for revenge.

19:32.600 --> 19:34.520
It might cause you trouble.

19:34.840 --> 19:36.160
Rest assured,

19:36.240 --> 19:37.720
I already have a perfect plan.

19:37.800 --> 19:39.520
He's walking straight to his doom.

19:42.320 --> 19:43.440
You rest well.

19:44.560 --> 19:45.720
I won't disturb you further.

19:47.760 --> 19:49.240
Guard strictly.

19:49.320 --> 19:50.360
Close the gates.

19:53.280 --> 19:54.480
Young Master.

19:55.000 --> 19:56.560
Mayor, why are you here?

19:56.640 --> 19:58.000
YANG FENG, MAYOR OF PANYI

19:58.080 --> 20:00.560
I heard Miss Xiaoqiao had woken up.
I came to visit her.

20:01.280 --> 20:03.680
She was badly frightened in Xindu.

20:04.240 --> 20:05.840
Don't bother her unless necessary.

20:06.600 --> 20:07.400
What if it is?

20:07.480 --> 20:09.000
Then report to me.

20:09.080 --> 20:11.760
I'll handle everything regarding Panyi.

20:14.360 --> 20:16.480
Good. There is one matter.

20:16.560 --> 20:18.120
Thirty li away, Wei Shao…

20:18.880 --> 20:20.360
That Wei rebel is leading troops here.

20:20.440 --> 20:21.720
They will arrive soon.

20:22.760 --> 20:24.480
He really came.

20:25.320 --> 20:27.560
He won't return alive.

20:32.320 --> 20:36.320
Although you used Lady Qiao's influence

20:36.400 --> 20:38.040
to open Panyi's gates,

20:38.120 --> 20:39.520
don't forget,

20:40.040 --> 20:43.600
that Wei boy has Panyi's seal.

20:44.160 --> 20:48.320
So to completely block him outside,

20:48.400 --> 20:50.800
we must mobilize the people's strength.

20:53.680 --> 20:55.320
Stir them up.

20:55.840 --> 20:56.760
Remember,

20:57.400 --> 21:00.520
the people's power is limitless.

21:04.480 --> 21:07.800
OUTSKIRTS OF PANYI, YANZHOU

21:24.520 --> 21:27.680
I heard that Wei Shao
has three eyes and four arms.

21:27.760 --> 21:31.000
The four great generals under him
are all bloodthirsty.

21:31.080 --> 21:33.720
If they break in,
they'll massacre the city.

21:33.800 --> 21:36.640
- He even chopped Li Su into pieces!
- Really?

21:36.720 --> 21:38.680
The Qiao and Wei clans are enemies.

21:38.760 --> 21:41.960
If we fall into his hands,
won't he skin us alive?

21:42.040 --> 21:43.000
Don't let him enter the city.

21:43.080 --> 21:44.880
- You're right.
- Yes.

21:44.960 --> 21:46.920
With Liangya's Young Master Liu
helping defend,

21:47.000 --> 21:48.880
plus our own desperate fight,
we definitely can win.

21:48.960 --> 21:49.680
Right!

21:49.760 --> 21:52.680
Young Master Liu was chosen by
Lord Qiao for Miss Xiaoqiao.

21:54.480 --> 21:58.920
Liu Yan uses these rumors
to stir up civilians to oppose Wei Shao.

21:59.520 --> 22:01.760
To conquer the mind is no marvel.

22:02.400 --> 22:04.200
But using common people to fight…

22:04.280 --> 22:05.760
Isn't that somewhat unkind?

22:09.480 --> 22:10.840
Greetings, Miss Xiaoqiao.

22:14.040 --> 22:15.960
GRAIN

22:16.040 --> 22:18.200
Is this the grain ordered
by Young Master Liu?

22:18.280 --> 22:19.120
Indeed.

22:23.280 --> 22:25.560
Why such a strong sulfur smell?

22:28.280 --> 22:29.320
What will it be used for?

22:29.400 --> 22:32.040
I'm just a humble mayor.

22:32.120 --> 22:36.200
I can't possibly know what plans
Young Master Liu has.

22:37.760 --> 22:38.840
Even you, miss.

22:38.920 --> 22:40.760
He won't let me meet you.

22:46.760 --> 22:49.040
Mayor Yang, you must be careful.

22:49.760 --> 22:52.280
By using this to harm the people,

22:52.360 --> 22:55.160
he may be able to deal with Wei Shao
without needing to do battle.

22:55.240 --> 22:56.360
But it can't be allowed.

22:57.600 --> 22:58.400
Understood.

23:01.400 --> 23:04.600
Wasn't it you who built
the Yongning Canal?

23:04.680 --> 23:05.600
Indeed.

23:06.240 --> 23:07.760
I haven't been there yet.

23:07.840 --> 23:09.320
Can you tell us the way?

23:09.400 --> 23:10.120
No problem.

23:11.080 --> 23:12.320
Just go straight ahead.

23:22.400 --> 23:23.840
Xiaoqiao, why are you here?

23:24.800 --> 23:27.520
The canal's been abandoned for years.
There's nothing worth seeing.

23:29.040 --> 23:30.840
I'm not here for the canal.

23:31.520 --> 23:33.560
I went to the temple for spirit inquiry.

23:34.200 --> 23:35.200
Spirit inquiry?

23:35.840 --> 23:37.960
About us?

23:38.480 --> 23:40.240
About tomorrow's weather.

23:41.840 --> 23:42.640
What did it say?

23:43.160 --> 23:45.000
The wind will come from the southeast.

23:45.960 --> 23:49.440
If you plan to use sulfur
against Wei Shao,

23:49.520 --> 23:53.280
remember to place sulfur southeast
for maximum fire effect.

23:54.480 --> 23:55.520
You already know?

23:56.200 --> 23:57.840
Fire is an unexpected tactic,

23:58.560 --> 24:01.400
but you must be careful with it.

24:01.480 --> 24:04.360
Don't place it in the wrong direction
and harm the Panyi people.

24:05.480 --> 24:06.640
You misunderstand me.

24:06.720 --> 24:08.920
Panyi will be my territory.

24:09.000 --> 24:11.040
They'll be my people.

24:11.120 --> 24:12.720
How could I sacrifice them?

24:13.840 --> 24:15.400
Then I overthought it.

24:15.880 --> 24:17.400
Hope you won't take it to heart.

24:18.080 --> 24:19.760
What I seek

24:19.840 --> 24:21.640
isn't just Wei Shao's life,

24:22.240 --> 24:23.840
but the entire Wei State.

24:24.560 --> 24:25.760
Fourteen years ago,

24:25.840 --> 24:27.440
the Qiao and Wei clans were friendly

24:27.520 --> 24:29.120
and built the Yongning Canal together,

24:29.200 --> 24:31.680
using Yanzhou water to irrigate Wei land.

24:32.320 --> 24:33.600
After Xindu was captured,

24:34.240 --> 24:36.160
Yongning Canal was abandoned by Li Su,

24:36.240 --> 24:37.920
causing a great drought in Wei.

24:38.560 --> 24:39.600
Xiaoqiao,

24:40.440 --> 24:43.040
this Panyi Dam has blocked water
for 14 years.

24:43.480 --> 24:45.360
If the water were released all at once,

24:45.440 --> 24:47.240
what would happen to Xindu?

24:50.400 --> 24:53.480
Yan, you mean the sulfur
won't be used against Wei Shao?

24:55.160 --> 24:57.160
Instead, it will be used as explosives

24:57.800 --> 25:00.080
to destroy the dam
blocking the Yongning Canal

25:00.160 --> 25:01.520
and Xindu will be flooded.

25:01.880 --> 25:03.920
Then Wei will suffer from
the chaos of flooding.

25:04.000 --> 25:06.480
It'll be a perfect time to attack.

25:06.560 --> 25:09.160
Wei Shao deserves death,
but the people are innocent.

25:09.240 --> 25:11.120
It's for the greater good.

25:11.200 --> 25:12.160
Blame it

25:12.600 --> 25:14.240
on their being born in Wei.

25:22.240 --> 25:24.240
So you only love

25:25.280 --> 25:27.320
your own people.

25:27.400 --> 25:29.520
When Panyi becomes my territory,

25:29.600 --> 25:30.880
I'll love them as well.

25:32.400 --> 25:35.000
Miss Xiaoqiao, why are you so anxious?

25:35.360 --> 25:38.280
Did that single engagement with Wei Shao

25:38.880 --> 25:42.160
make you believe
that you'd become part of Wei?

25:43.680 --> 25:46.160
She just pities the people.

25:46.240 --> 25:49.400
Even Wei Shao tore down the People's Wall
to comfort his people.

25:49.880 --> 25:53.560
Your plan is more cruel
than Li Su's three-day massacre.

25:55.720 --> 25:57.880
I've planned all this for you, Xiaoqiao.

25:57.960 --> 25:59.520
You and Wei Shao have a deep hatred.

25:59.600 --> 26:03.320
If I don't scheme against Wei today,
he'll flatten Yanzhou tomorrow.

26:03.400 --> 26:04.480
He won't.

26:06.240 --> 26:07.280
But you…

26:08.960 --> 26:12.400
you're just using my name
to satisfy your own ambitions.

26:22.040 --> 26:23.040
These days,

26:24.200 --> 26:25.400
the city is unstable.

26:26.920 --> 26:28.680
It's better not to wander around.

26:34.280 --> 26:35.720
Escort my cousin back

26:36.720 --> 26:37.640
and guard her closely.

26:49.480 --> 26:51.440
Though Panyi is Miss Xiaoqiao's dowry,

26:51.520 --> 26:53.760
we still need to make it profitable.

26:55.120 --> 26:56.400
- Take her away.
- Yes.

26:57.360 --> 26:58.120
What are you doing?

26:58.680 --> 26:59.480
Move.

27:00.480 --> 27:01.520
What are you doing?

27:02.280 --> 27:04.160
Young Master Liu
ordered you to protect us.

27:04.240 --> 27:05.920
He didn't mean for you to tie us up.

27:06.640 --> 27:07.960
Shut up.

27:08.040 --> 27:09.400
This is protecting you.

27:11.080 --> 27:11.880
Think about it.

27:12.240 --> 27:14.480
Once tied up, you can't move.

27:15.320 --> 27:17.080
What accidents would you have?

27:17.160 --> 27:19.400
- What?
- This is the greatest protection.

27:20.080 --> 27:21.720
What nonsense is this?

27:28.200 --> 27:29.160
Untie us!

27:29.240 --> 27:30.840
- Guard closely.
- Yes.

27:30.920 --> 27:31.960
Bah!

27:33.040 --> 27:34.720
My lady, are you okay?

27:34.800 --> 27:37.360
I thought Liu Yan would treat us politely.

27:37.440 --> 27:40.560
Who could have guessed
he'd treat us like prisoners?

27:40.640 --> 27:42.240
Even the Lord of Wei was better.

27:42.320 --> 27:43.920
Now you think he's good?

27:44.560 --> 27:47.720
Though the Lord of Wei looks fierce
and speaks harshly,

27:47.800 --> 27:49.960
he didn't tie us up.

27:50.040 --> 27:51.960
He still expelled Miss Xiaoqiao
from Xindu.

27:52.040 --> 27:55.640
At the end of the day, Young Master Liu
only needs to treat Miss Xiaoqiao well.

27:55.720 --> 27:57.440
Now is not the time for this.

27:57.520 --> 27:58.840
Think about how to escape

27:58.920 --> 28:00.440
and keep your voices down.

28:00.520 --> 28:01.800
Walls have ears.

28:01.880 --> 28:03.360
Enemy at the gates! Alert!

28:03.440 --> 28:04.160
PANYI, YANZHOU

28:04.240 --> 28:05.080
Yes!

28:28.040 --> 28:29.400
Wei rebels.

28:29.480 --> 28:30.920
Despite their schemes,

28:31.440 --> 28:33.160
Panyi is now in my hands.

28:44.000 --> 28:45.000
Fire!

28:49.640 --> 28:50.480
Young Master!

28:55.000 --> 28:59.760
Wei State!

29:04.080 --> 29:06.000
Fire arrows!

29:31.160 --> 29:32.440
Panyi is hard to attack.

29:32.520 --> 29:35.200
Even if Wei Shao has the gods' power,
he won't make it.

29:35.760 --> 29:37.040
Hold him up for two days.

29:37.560 --> 29:38.840
When the sulfur is ready,

29:39.240 --> 29:41.040
Wei will be doomed.

29:43.800 --> 29:44.560
Attack!

29:56.520 --> 29:57.440
My lady,

29:57.520 --> 29:58.920
let me bite it loose.

29:59.000 --> 30:00.400
With your teeth?

30:00.480 --> 30:02.160
How long will that take?

30:07.520 --> 30:08.920
My lady, what are you doing?

30:09.000 --> 30:09.840
My lady.

30:13.880 --> 30:16.000
No, my lady! You'll hurt yourself.

30:16.080 --> 30:17.480
Shh, the guards are outside.

30:17.560 --> 30:19.160
Don't, my lady. You'll get hurt.

30:20.080 --> 30:21.560
Why suffer like this?

30:21.640 --> 30:24.360
Seeing you like this, I'm heartbroken.

30:24.960 --> 30:26.520
Panyi is hard to attack.

30:27.920 --> 30:29.680
If Wei Shao is held up for two days,

30:29.760 --> 30:33.440
Liu Yan will have all the sulfur ready
and destroy the dam.

30:33.520 --> 30:34.840
The water will flood Wei.

30:34.920 --> 30:36.080
What about Wei's people?

30:36.160 --> 30:37.960
If Wei Shao wants to take Panyi,

30:38.040 --> 30:39.480
we must coordinate inside and out.

30:39.560 --> 30:41.480
Have you forgotten
how the Lord of Wei treated you?

30:42.280 --> 30:43.520
This is my fault.

30:44.240 --> 30:47.320
I originally wanted
to fight fire with fire,

30:47.400 --> 30:49.040
only to get burned myself.

30:50.640 --> 30:52.800
I can't let the people die for nothing.

30:53.200 --> 30:54.760
You don't even know where sulfur is.

30:54.840 --> 30:57.680
That day, I saw grain carts.

30:57.760 --> 30:59.520
They probably carried sulfur.

31:00.240 --> 31:02.480
I think the sulfur is in the granary.

31:02.560 --> 31:04.680
You're safe here. Wait for me.

31:04.760 --> 31:05.920
My lady.

31:06.000 --> 31:07.320
You can't act alone.

31:07.400 --> 31:08.240
It's dangerous.

31:08.320 --> 31:09.440
Come back!

32:11.920 --> 32:12.920
Who's there?

32:13.360 --> 32:14.760
How did you get in?

32:14.840 --> 32:16.000
The granary is restricted.

32:16.080 --> 32:17.960
You're not allowed here.

32:35.640 --> 32:36.440
Who are you?

32:36.520 --> 32:37.360
Halt!

32:38.960 --> 32:39.880
What are you doing?

32:40.640 --> 32:41.520
Halt!

33:01.800 --> 33:02.640
Stop!

33:04.080 --> 33:05.080
You search over there.

33:05.160 --> 33:06.000
Yes.

33:15.520 --> 33:16.720
Be careful.

33:16.800 --> 33:17.640
Quick.

33:18.080 --> 33:18.920
Quick, someone!

33:19.760 --> 33:20.680
Be careful.

33:24.000 --> 33:24.920
My lord.

33:25.000 --> 33:26.200
Though it was just a feint,

33:26.280 --> 33:28.240
Panyi's defenders fought like crazy.

33:28.320 --> 33:30.200
Many common people joined them too.

33:30.760 --> 33:31.840
We took heavy casualties.

33:32.400 --> 33:34.240
Liu Yan only arrived a few days ago.

33:34.920 --> 33:37.400
Why do Panyi people trust him so?

33:37.480 --> 33:38.960
It must be deception.

33:39.560 --> 33:41.880
They must have been bewitched
by Liu Yan and Lady Qiao.

33:41.960 --> 33:43.840
That's why they take us as invaders.

33:48.480 --> 33:49.600
Wheat.

33:54.840 --> 33:55.800
Sulfur.

34:05.320 --> 34:06.320
What happened?

34:14.280 --> 34:15.600
My lord, it's sulfur.

34:16.760 --> 34:17.960
Sulfur smells strong.

34:18.040 --> 34:19.199
It makes horses snort.

34:19.600 --> 34:20.520
Sulfur?

34:21.199 --> 34:21.960
Fire attack.

34:22.560 --> 34:23.600
Fire attack!

34:23.679 --> 34:25.199
It would harm civilians.

34:25.280 --> 34:27.239
Liangya produces much sulfur.

34:27.600 --> 34:29.679
Liu Yan plans a fire attack.

34:29.760 --> 34:32.159
I expected Liu Yan to be despicable,

34:32.239 --> 34:33.880
but I didn't expect him to be this vile.

34:34.880 --> 34:37.840
Seems like there is enough sulfur
to burn down the city.

34:38.320 --> 34:41.239
It's likely they'll ignite it all at once
when we enter the city.

34:41.600 --> 34:42.920
If it succeeds,

34:43.000 --> 34:45.960
Panyi will become hell instantly.

34:46.679 --> 34:48.080
Liu Yan's cruelty

34:48.560 --> 34:50.679
exceeds Li Su's back then.

34:51.239 --> 34:52.320
This wretched guy.

34:52.400 --> 34:54.239
Killing him would be letting him off easy.

34:54.840 --> 34:56.239
My lord, I'll order the soldiers

34:56.320 --> 34:58.320
to halt the attack
and wait for the right moment.

35:00.480 --> 35:01.720
Fire!

35:01.800 --> 35:02.640
Quick, put out the fire!

35:02.720 --> 35:03.760
Yes.

35:05.000 --> 35:06.360
The granary is on fire!

35:06.440 --> 35:07.120
Quick, someone!

35:07.200 --> 35:08.720
- Fire!
- Put out the fire!

35:09.200 --> 35:10.160
Put out the fire!

35:10.240 --> 35:11.840
Quick, put out the fire!

35:12.840 --> 35:14.640
The granary is on fire.

35:15.240 --> 35:16.880
Come put out the fire!

35:27.840 --> 35:30.240
Come put out the fire!

35:30.320 --> 35:31.120
Quick!

35:33.960 --> 35:36.160
The granary is on fire!

35:36.240 --> 35:37.240
Quick, get water!

35:37.320 --> 35:38.520
Put out the fire!

35:39.120 --> 35:41.240
Report!

35:42.600 --> 35:43.840
Panyi's granary is on fire.

35:43.920 --> 35:45.400
It ignited the sulfur.
It's in chaos.

35:49.280 --> 35:50.440
What?

35:53.280 --> 35:54.840
It's in the granary.

35:56.840 --> 35:58.960
Liu Yan reaps what he sows.

35:59.960 --> 36:01.840
The remnants of the Liangya forces
are in chaos.

36:03.320 --> 36:04.400
Heaven helps us.

36:07.880 --> 36:09.160
Pass my order.

36:10.080 --> 36:11.520
Full-scale attack!

36:11.600 --> 36:12.480
Yes!

36:12.560 --> 36:14.280
Avenge my lord's stolen wife!

36:15.160 --> 36:16.040
Go.

36:32.560 --> 36:33.400
Someone!

36:34.400 --> 36:35.280
Where are they?

36:39.760 --> 36:40.720
Young Master!

36:41.280 --> 36:42.160
Young Master!

36:42.240 --> 36:43.640
The soldiers can't handle it.

36:43.720 --> 36:45.320
We must abandon the city.

36:52.360 --> 36:54.320
There's no time to hesitate.

36:58.360 --> 36:59.320
No.

37:00.440 --> 37:01.640
I must find Xiaoqiao.

37:03.120 --> 37:03.960
Young Master!

37:04.840 --> 37:06.000
Personal guards!

37:06.080 --> 37:07.160
Follow me!

37:07.240 --> 37:08.240
Yes!

37:15.960 --> 37:17.080
Capture Lady Qiao!

37:17.160 --> 37:18.560
Kill her to boost morale!

37:18.640 --> 37:20.200
Capture Lady Qiao!

37:20.280 --> 37:21.640
Kill her to boost morale!

37:25.400 --> 37:26.520
My lord.

37:26.600 --> 37:27.720
Where's Liu Yan?

37:27.800 --> 37:29.000
Not found yet.

37:29.080 --> 37:30.000
What about Lady Qiao?

37:30.080 --> 37:31.200
We're still dealing with
Liangya's remnants.

37:31.280 --> 37:32.800
There's no time to find her.

37:32.880 --> 37:33.840
Liu Yan fled the city.

37:33.920 --> 37:35.680
He might have taken Lady Qiao with him.

37:37.320 --> 37:38.880
We must find Lady Qiao,

37:38.960 --> 37:39.960
alive

37:40.040 --> 37:41.000
or dead.

37:41.080 --> 37:42.160
Yes!

37:42.240 --> 37:43.160
Let's go!

37:43.240 --> 37:44.080
Go!

37:57.240 --> 37:59.960
This is Lady Qiao's place.
Search it carefully!

38:00.040 --> 38:01.280
Yes!

38:01.360 --> 38:02.520
General Wei Liang!

38:03.080 --> 38:03.880
General Wei Liang!

38:03.960 --> 38:05.640
General Wei Liang.

38:06.760 --> 38:08.160
- General.
- I've been looking for you.

38:08.240 --> 38:10.520
- Where's Lady Qiao?
- She went to set the fire.

38:10.600 --> 38:12.640
Her hands were still injured.
Please help me find her.

38:12.720 --> 38:14.560
Don't let Liu Yan catch her.

38:16.160 --> 38:18.440
Do you mean she started the fire?

38:18.880 --> 38:19.880
Yes.

38:19.960 --> 38:21.960
Wasn't she eloping with Liu Yan?

38:22.040 --> 38:23.360
Why help our attack?

38:23.440 --> 38:25.320
That's not important. Please…

38:25.400 --> 38:26.720
Greetings, my lord.

38:26.800 --> 38:29.560
Generals, I'm Yang Feng,
the Mayor of Panyi.

38:30.040 --> 38:34.360
Miss Xiaoqiao was abducted by Liu Yan.

38:34.440 --> 38:35.480
She was held captive.

38:35.560 --> 38:37.480
Even I wasn't allowed to visit her.

38:37.560 --> 38:40.000
The elopement rumor is false.

38:40.080 --> 38:42.520
Miss Xiaoqiao learned that
Liu planned to use sulfur

38:42.600 --> 38:44.800
to destroy the dam blocking
the Yongning Canal and flood Xindu,

38:44.880 --> 38:47.240
so she sent me to stop it.

38:47.680 --> 38:50.520
Destroy the dam and flood Xindu?

38:50.600 --> 38:51.560
- Yes.
- Yes.

38:51.640 --> 38:53.680
Miss Xiaoqiao cares for the Lord of Wei,

38:53.760 --> 38:57.960
so she started a fire and created
an opportunity for your attack.

38:59.080 --> 39:01.720
Do you mean she was forced to come here?

39:01.800 --> 39:03.000
Yes.

39:03.080 --> 39:05.800
Lord Wei, if you doubt it,
please look at these betrothal gifts.

39:05.880 --> 39:07.480
What a mess!

39:08.360 --> 39:09.920
She even received betrothal gifts.

39:12.920 --> 39:13.720
What's this?

39:14.440 --> 39:15.720
The betrothal beast.

39:15.800 --> 39:18.480
They didn't want to bother hunting a lynx,

39:18.560 --> 39:20.440
so they hunted a weasel instead.

39:20.520 --> 39:21.360
Lord Wei,

39:21.440 --> 39:24.160
please save Miss Xiaoqiao
before it's too late.

39:24.240 --> 39:26.120
Liu Yan's men are seeking her.

39:26.200 --> 39:27.520
So are our men.

39:27.600 --> 39:29.520
Why are you seeking her?

39:29.600 --> 39:30.800
- For morale.
- Morale?

39:33.240 --> 39:34.160
Go.

40:19.440 --> 40:20.560
General Wei Xiao.

40:21.440 --> 40:23.760
Liu Yan plans to destroy the dam
and flood Xindu.

40:35.040 --> 40:36.000
What?

40:36.840 --> 40:38.160
Did you think I came to save you?

40:39.520 --> 40:41.280
At the Battle of Xindu,

40:42.360 --> 40:44.920
if the Qiao clan hadn't betrayed us,

40:45.560 --> 40:47.760
my father and brothers wouldn't have died,

40:49.240 --> 40:50.480
my mother…

40:52.920 --> 40:55.440
wouldn't have died of grief,

40:55.520 --> 40:56.360
and I

40:57.280 --> 41:00.280
wouldn't have become a wild child
fighting wolves for food.

41:01.400 --> 41:02.400
So,

41:03.080 --> 41:04.400
all members of the Qiao clan

41:05.520 --> 41:06.720
deserve death.
